 collection at your fingertips in a sleek, immersive interface.\n\nFilter by tags, performers, studios. Sort however you like. \nFind exactly what you're looking for in seconds.\nWatch your media in flat-screen mode or fully immersive VR/XR.\n\nFeatures:\n\n- Full search, filter, and sort across your Stash library\n- Flat-screen and immersive VR/XR playback modes\n- Connects to your self-hosted Stash server over your local network\n- Clean, fast interface designed for headset navigation\n- Private - your library stays on your server", "short_description": "Browse, search, and stream your Stash library from your headset. \n\n- Filter by tags, performers, studios\n- Watch in flat-screen or fully immersive VR/XR mode. \n- Connects to your self-hosted Stash server.\n\nYour collection, your headset, fully private."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.stashxr.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "StashXR", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://stashxr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "27145614541707893"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 4, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2350466075714323"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1018768854470596"}, {"status": "CANCELLED", "id": "1458538138865130"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2074081040116468"}]}, "baseline_of